noff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":9062,"open_issues":985,"watchers":53172,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/pulls/3607","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/pull/3607","diff_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/pull/3607.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/pull/3607.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fix: #3599 \r\n\r\nWhen the component has the `emits` options, the `ThisType` of the `nextTick` function may be incompatible with the component instance, e.g.\r\n\r\n```js\r\n  defineComponent({\r\n    emits: ['click']\r\n  })\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `$emit`'s type of the component instance is:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n(event: \"click\", n: number) => void\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut the `$emit`'s type of `ThisType` of `$nextTick` is:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n(event: string, n: number) => void\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo there is a type incompatibility `'Type 'string' is not assignable to type '\"click\"''`. At first, I tried to unify their types, but I failed, maybe @pikax can give it another try.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/3607/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/3607/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"pikax","id":4620458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjA0NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4620458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikax","html_url":"https://github.com/pikax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikax/gists{/gist_id}","sta